    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d675">

                <pb facs="0787" n="713" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg713"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/3110</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Archangel</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 1, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received 5.15 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>535. On receipt of your cable September 24, 5 p.m.,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d675-f1"
                    /> I sent copy thereof to provisional government for its information: prompt
                    reply was received approving action and saying sovereign Archangel government
                    expressed entire sympathy with sentiments expressed by you and hoped that our
                    noble aim would be accomplished and— <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Government convinced that all nations acknowledging themselves morally
                            responsible to uphold human rights of mankind will unite their efforts
                            in supporting movement which America has initiated.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
